config BR2_PACKAGE_FFMPEG_AAC
	bool "ffmpeg-aac"
	help
	  A minimal static libavcodec + libavutil for trxd's DATV audio:
	  the Opus decoder and the AAC-LC encoder only (the browser sends
	  Opus, the transport stream carries AAC-LC in ADTS, as DVB
	  receivers expect). No programs, no shared libraries: only the
	  code trxd calls ends up in the image. LGPL-2.1+.
